        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "Liu Jia was crying. So Miss White asked her, \"What's the matter, Liu Jia? You look sad.\" Liu Jia answered, \"I'm feeling down. My good friend Lucy moved to another city.\"",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "Miss White listened carefully and told Liu Jia, \"Think about happy things. Call your friend or send her some emails.\"",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "\"I tried that, but I still feel unhappy.\" said Liu Jia.",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "Miss White gave her a glass of water. \"Maybe you can do some exercise. Exercise may cheer you up.\"",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "\"Join some after-school clubs and make new friends! You can talk and have fun with them.\" added Miss White.",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "\"I will try. Thank you, Miss White.\" said Liu Jia.",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "Dear Miss White,",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "I often make video calls with my friend now. I also joined a ping-pong club and made some new friends. I feel much better. Thank you so much!",
